                      "fontFamily": "'Segoe UI Semibold', wf_segoe-ui_semibold, helvetica, arial, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "16px",
                      "color": "#12233D"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "  the operating profit a move adds in a full year once it is live, measured in 2032 (its run-rate).",
